  "category": "Sources",
  "prefix": "BT",
  "description": "Lithium iron phosphate cells, 3.2 V nominal, 3.65 V full, 2.5 V empty; Thevenin model (open-circuit voltage from the state of charge, series resistance and an RC pair) with a time acceleration for chargers; shows the state of charge. No temperature, aging or self-discharge",
